  {
   "screen": "Colour mixing: RGB, CMYK, hex codes and new colours",
   "title": "Figure 1.2.3 · Additive RGB, subtractive CMYK and the hex code",
   "alt": "Left: three overlapping circles labelled Red, Green and Blue light; red and green overlap to make yellow, green and blue make cyan, red and blue make magenta, and the centre where all three overlap is white. Notes: screens, more light is brighter; all on is white, all off is black. Right: three overlapping circles labelled Cyan, Magenta and Yellow ink; cyan and magenta make blue, magenta and yellow make red, cyan and yellow make green, and the centre is a dark brown. Notes: print, more ink is darker, so K black is added; no ink is white paper. Bottom: the hex code #1FA3A3 split into three pairs, 1F for red (little red), A3 for green and A3 for blue (plenty of each); each pair runs from 00, none, to FF, full, which is 255; 256 times 256 times 256 gives about 16.7 million colours.",
   "caption": "Light adds up to white; ink subtracts towards a muddy dark, which is why printers add black. A hex code is just the three light channels written as pairs.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 452\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><text x=\"160\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">RGB: additive (light)</text><text x=\"480\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">CMY(K): subtractive (ink)</text><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"109.3\" r=\"64\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"197\" cy=\"173.4\" r=\"64\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"123\" cy=\"173.4\" r=\"64\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"84.3\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Red</text><text x=\"223\" y=\"193.4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Green</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"193.4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Blue</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Yellow</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Cyan</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Magenta</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">White</text><circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"109.3\" r=\"64\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"517\" cy=\"173.4\" r=\"64\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"443\" cy=\"173.4\" r=\"64\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"84.3\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Cyan</text><text x=\"543\" y=\"193.4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Magenta</text><text x=\"417\" y=\"193.4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Yellow</text><text x=\"525\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Blue</text><text x=\"480\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Red</text><text x=\"435\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Green</text><text x=\"480\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"480\" dy=\"0em\">dark</tspan><tspan x=\"480\" dy=\"1.25em\">brown</tspan></text><text x=\"160\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">Screens: more light = brighter</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">all on = white · all off = black</text><text x=\"480\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">Print: more ink = darker; so K (black) is added</text><text x=\"480\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">no ink = white paper</text><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"300\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"322\" width=\"620\" height=\"122\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"346\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Hex code anatomy: #RRGGBB</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"392\" font-size=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">#</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"362\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"246\" y=\"388.7\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">1F</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"418\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\">red</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"362\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"388.7\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A3</text><text x=\"342\" y=\"418\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\">green</text><rect x=\"396\" y=\"362\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"438\" y=\"388.7\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A3</text><text x=\"438\" y=\"418\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\">blue</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"24\" dy=\"0em\">Each pair: 00 (none)</tspan><tspan x=\"24\" dy=\"1.2em\">to FF (full = 255)</tspan></text><text x=\"320\" y=\"436\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">#1FA3A3 is a teal: little red, plenty of green and blue</text><text x=\"506\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"506\" dy=\"0em\">256 × 256 × 256</tspan><tspan x=\"506\" dy=\"1.2em\">≈ 16.7 million</tspan><tspan x=\"506\" dy=\"1.2em\">colours</tspan></text></svg>"
  }
