  {
   "screen": "Ethical standards: plagiarism, attribution, fair use and Creative Commons",
   "title": "Figure 2.2.3 · What each Creative Commons licence allows",
   "alt": "A table answering three questions for each licence: must I credit, commercial use, and can I change it. CC0: credit not required, commercial use yes, changes yes. CC BY: credit yes, commercial yes, changes yes. CC BY-SA: credit yes, commercial yes, changes yes but share under the same licence. CC BY-NC: credit yes, commercial no, changes yes. CC BY-NC-SA: credit yes, commercial no, changes yes under the same licence. CC BY-ND: credit yes, commercial yes, changes no. CC BY-NC-ND: credit yes, commercial no, changes no. Key: BY means credit the creator; SA means share adaptations under the same licence; NC means no commercial use; ND means no changes or remixes; CC0 means public domain. Rows run from most open to most restrictive.",
   "caption": "Read the letters to answer the three questions: BY means credit, NC rules out commercial use, ND rules out changes. Every CC licence except CC0 includes BY.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><text x=\"250\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Must I credit?</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Commercial use?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Can I change it?</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"40\" width=\"620\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"61\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">CC0</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"61\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">not required</text><path d=\"M363 56L367.9 60.9L377 50.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"61\" font-size=\"13\">yes</text><path d=\"M513 56L517.9 60.9L527 50.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"536\" y=\"61\" font-size=\"13\">yes</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"76\" width=\"620\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">CC BY</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">yes</text><path d=\"M363 92L367.9 96.9L377 86.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"13\">yes</text><path d=\"M513 92L517.9 96.9L527 86.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"536\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"13\">yes</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"112\" width=\"620\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">CC BY-SA</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">yes</text><path d=\"M363 128L367.9 132.9L377 122.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"13\">yes</text><path d=\"M477 128L481.9 132.9L491 122.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"13\">yes, same licence</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"148\" width=\"620\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">CC BY-NC</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">yes</text><path d=\"M370 158L382 170M382 158L370 170\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">no</text><path d=\"M513 164L517.9 168.9L527 158.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"536\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"13\">yes</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"184\" width=\"620\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">CC BY-NC-SA</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">yes</text><path d=\"M370 194L382 206M382 194L370 206\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">no</text><path d=\"M477 200L481.9 204.9L491 194.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"13\">yes, same licence</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"220\" width=\"620\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">CC BY-ND</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">yes</text><path d=\"M363 236L367.9 240.9L377 230.4\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"13\">yes</text><path d=\"M520 230L532 242M532 230L520 242\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">no</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"256\" width=\"620\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">CC BY-NC-ND</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">yes</text><path d=\"M370 266L382 278M382 266L370 278\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">no</text><path d=\"M520 266L532 278M532 266L520 278\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">no</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">BY = credit the creator · SA = share adaptations under the same licence</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">NC = no commercial use · ND = no changes or remixes · CC0 = public domain</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" font-style=\"italic\">Rows run from most open (top) to most restrictive (bottom).</text></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Copyright law in digital content creation",
   "title": "Figure 2.2.4 · What copyright protects, and for how long",
   "alt": "Two boxes. Protected automatically once fixed in any form: writing, scripts and lyrics; music and sound recordings; photographs, films and videos; artwork and graphics; software code and broadcasts; the layout of published editions. Not protected by copyright: ideas; facts; titles and short phrases; names and slogans, which trademarks may protect instead; expired works in the public domain. Below, bars for how long copyright lasts: an author's life plus 50 years under the Berne minimum; life plus 70 years in the Netherlands and the United States; life plus 95 years in Jamaica since 2015.",
   "caption": "No registration or © symbol is needed: protection starts the moment a work is fixed. The term after the author's death depends on the territory.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 356\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"304\" height=\"196\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"326\" y=\"10\" width=\"304\" height=\"196\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"162\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Protected automatically</text><text x=\"162\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">once fixed in any form</text><text x=\"478\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Not protected by copyright</text><path d=\"M26 76L30.2 80.2L38 71.2\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"13\">writing, scripts, lyrics</text><path d=\"M26 97L30.2 101.2L38 92.2\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"13\">music and sound recordings</text><path d=\"M26 118L30.2 122.2L38 113.2\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"123\" font-size=\"13\">photographs, films, videos</text><path d=\"M26 139L30.2 143.2L38 134.2\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"13\">artwork and graphics</text><path d=\"M26 160L30.2 164.2L38 155.2\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"13\">software code, broadcasts</text><path d=\"M26 181L30.2 185.2L38 176.2\" class=\"s-ok f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"13\">layout of published editions</text><path d=\"M343 71L353 81M353 71L343 81\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"13\">ideas</text><path d=\"M343 92L353 102M353 92L343 102\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"13\">facts</text><path d=\"M343 113L353 123M353 113L343 123\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"123\" font-size=\"13\">titles and short phrases</text><path d=\"M343 134L353 144M353 134L343 144\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"13\">names and slogans (trademarks may)</text><path d=\"M343 155L353 165M353 155L343 165\" class=\"s-bad f-none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"13\">expired works: public domain</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">How long it lasts</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Berne minimum</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"250\" width=\"110\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"195\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">author's life</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"250\" width=\"130\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"388\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">+ 50 years</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Netherlands, US</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"284\" width=\"110\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"195\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">author's life</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"284\" width=\"182\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"440\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">+ 70 years</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"333\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Jamaica (2015)</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"318\" width=\"110\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"195\" y=\"334\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">author's life</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"318\" width=\"247\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"505\" y=\"334\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">+ 95 years</text></svg>"
  }
