   "screen": "Design principles 2: hierarchy, contrast, spacing, visual flow",
   "title": "Figure 2.3.4 · An annotated home page with a Z-pattern",
   "alt": "A wireframe of the Island Pulse Media home page with a dashed Z-shaped path numbered 1 to 4: from the logo at top left, across to the menu at top right, diagonally down across the hero band to the bottom left, then across to a gold Start a project button at bottom right. Annotations: hierarchy, the headline is the largest element; rule of thirds, the headline sits on the top-left third; contrast, white text on a deep teal band; spacing, 32 px between sections; visual flow, the button sits where the Z ends.",
   "caption": "On a simple page the eye travels in a Z, so the call to action goes where the Z finishes. Each annotation names a principle and where it is used, which is what examiners want.",
