  {
   "screen": "SEO helps the right people find your content",
   "title": "Figure 2.4.3 · How search works, and the parts of a search result you control",
   "alt": "Top: three steps joined by arrows. Crawling: bots visit pages and follow links. Indexing: what they read is stored in the index. Ranking: indexed pages are ordered by relevance and quality. Note: if a crawler cannot read your content, it is never indexed or ranked. Bottom: a search result for the Taste of Castries page showing the address example.com taste-of-castries, the title Taste of Castries: Street Food Near Castries Cruise Port, and a two-line description. Labels underneath: URL slug, short and readable; title tag, 50 to 60 characters with the keyword near the front; meta description, 150 to 160 characters, which persuades people to click.",
   "caption": "You write the title tag, slug and meta description yourself, so they are the cheapest SEO wins. Use the keyword naturally; never stuff it.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 378\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M2U4f3-m0\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"86\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"30.8\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Crawling</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"51.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"106\" dy=\"0em\">bots visit pages and</tspan><tspan x=\"106\" dy=\"1.25em\">follow links</tspan></text><path d=\"M204 52L222 52\" class=\"s-gold f-none\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U4f3-m0)\"/><rect x=\"224\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"86\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"30.8\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Indexing</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"51.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"0em\">what they read is</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"1.25em\">stored in the index</tspan></text><path d=\"M418 52L436 52\" class=\"s-gold f-none\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U4f3-m0)\"/><rect x=\"438\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"86\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"534\" y=\"30.8\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Ranking</text><text x=\"534\" y=\"51.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"534\" dy=\"0em\">indexed pages ordered</tspan><tspan x=\"534\" dy=\"1.25em\">by relevance and</tspan><tspan x=\"534\" dy=\"1.25em\">quality</tspan></text><text x=\"320\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-style=\"italic\">If a crawler cannot read your content, it is never indexed or ranked.</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">What the searcher sees</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"160\" width=\"620\" height=\"106\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">example.com › taste-of-castries</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"16\" class=\"f-gold\" font-weight=\"700\">Taste of Castries: Street Food Near Castries Cruise Port</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"13\">Six street-food stops a short walk from the pier, with prices, opening hours</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"13\">and tips for getting back on board in time...</text><line x1=\"105\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"290\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"290\" width=\"190\" height=\"78\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"105\" y=\"325.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"105\" dy=\"0em\">URL slug: short,</tspan><tspan x=\"105\" dy=\"1.25em\">readable</tspan></text><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"290\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"290\" width=\"220\" height=\"78\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"317.3\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"0em\">Title tag: 50 to 60</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"1.25em\">characters, keyword near</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"1.25em\">the front</tspan></text><line x1=\"535\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"535\" y2=\"290\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"440\" y=\"290\" width=\"190\" height=\"78\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"535\" y=\"309.2\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"535\" dy=\"0em\">Meta description: 150</tspan><tspan x=\"535\" dy=\"1.25em\">to 160 characters that</tspan><tspan x=\"535\" dy=\"1.25em\">persuade people to</tspan><tspan x=\"535\" dy=\"1.25em\">click</tspan></text></svg>"
  }
