   "screen": "APIs and the one-story, four-heads case",
   "title": "Figure 2.10.3 · An API works like a waiter",
   "alt": "Top: the restaurant analogy in three boxes. The table is the app or website that wants content; the waiter is the API, which carries requests and responses; the kitchen is the content repository. Arrows show the order or request going from table to waiter to kitchen, and the meal or data coming back. Middle left: the response arrives as data in JSON: headline \"Hurricane advisory: tropical storm watch\", date \"2026-09-10\", location \"Kingstown\", summary \"Shelters open at 4 p.m.\". Middle right: each head displays it its own way: a large banner on the website, a short push notification in the app, and a paragraph in the newsletter. Bottom: one story, four heads at the Windward Islands Weekly: website, app push notification, morning email newsletter and office lobby screen. The reporter publishes once; the API sends it to every head.",
   "caption": "The API never decides how the story looks; it only carries the data. In a headless answer use three key words: decoupled, API and multi-channel.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 456\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M2U10f3-m0\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"10\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">The restaurant analogy</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"32\" width=\"176\" height=\"128\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"68\" y=\"58\" width=\"60\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"94\" y=\"64\" width=\"8\" height=\"22\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"112\" y=\"40\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" rx=\"2.5\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">The table</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"123\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"98\" dy=\"0em\">the app or website</tspan><tspan x=\"98\" dy=\"1.15em\">that wants content</tspan></text><rect x=\"232\" y=\"32\" width=\"176\" height=\"128\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"48.1\" r=\"8.1\" class=\"f-ongold\"/><path d=\"M304.7 80.5Q304.7 58.9 320 58.9Q335.3 58.9 335.3 80.5Z\" class=\"f-ongold\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">The waiter</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"123\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\"><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"0em\">the API: carries</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"1.15em\">requests and</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"1.15em\">responses</tspan></text><rect x=\"454\" y=\"32\" width=\"176\" height=\"128\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"512\" y=\"48\" width=\"60\" height=\"36\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M528 56V76A14 3.9 0 0 0 556 76V56\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><ellipse cx=\"542\" cy=\"56\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"3.9\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"542\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">The kitchen</text><text x=\"542\" y=\"123\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"542\" dy=\"0em\">the content</tspan><tspan x=\"542\" dy=\"1.15em\">repository</tspan></text><path d=\"M190 72L228 72\" class=\"s-gold f-none\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U10f3-m0)\"/><path d=\"M228 112L190 112\" class=\"s-gold f-none\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U10f3-m0)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><path d=\"M412 72L450 72\" class=\"s-gold f-none\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U10f3-m0)\"/><path d=\"M450 112L412 112\" class=\"s-gold f-none\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U10f3-m0)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">order</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">meal</text><text x=\"432\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">request</text><text x=\"432\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">data</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">The response arrives as data (JSON)</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"200\" width=\"300\" height=\"132\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"13\">{</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">\"headline\": \"Hurricane advisory:</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">tropical storm watch\",</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">\"date\": \"2026-09-10\",</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">\"location\": \"Kingstown\",</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">\"summary\": \"Shelters open at 4 p.m.\"</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"13\">}</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Each head displays it its own way</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"200\" width=\"300\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"208\" width=\"280\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"223.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">HURRICANE ADVISORY</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">Website: a large banner</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"260\" width=\"300\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"268\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Tropical storm watch</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"293\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">App: a short push notification</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"308\" width=\"300\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">Newsletter: a paragraph</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">One story, four heads at the Windward Islands Weekly</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"374\" width=\"147.5\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"83.8\" y=\"398.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Website</text><rect x=\"167.5\" y=\"374\" width=\"147.5\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"241.2\" y=\"390.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"241.2\" dy=\"0em\">App push</tspan><tspan x=\"241.2\" dy=\"1.25em\">notification</tspan></text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"374\" width=\"147.5\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"398.8\" y=\"390.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"398.8\" dy=\"0em\">Morning email</tspan><tspan x=\"398.8\" dy=\"1.25em\">newsletter</tspan></text><rect x=\"482.5\" y=\"374\" width=\"147.5\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"556.2\" y=\"390.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"556.2\" dy=\"0em\">Office lobby</tspan><tspan x=\"556.2\" dy=\"1.25em\">screen</tspan></text><text x=\"320\" y=\"438\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">The reporter publishes once; the API sends it to every head.</text></svg>"
