  {
   "screen": "Step-by-step build: the Johnny Cake Counter",
   "title": "Figure 3.6.3 · The Johnny Cake Counter: the screen and its component tree",
   "alt": "Left: the App Inventor Viewer showing the finished screen. The title bar reads Johnny Cake Counter. Below it the heading \"How many johnny cakes?\", then a dashed horizontal arrangement holding a minus button, the count 0 and a plus button, then \"Total: US$0\", then two wide buttons, Read my total and Start again. Under the phone: non-visible components, TextToSpeech1. Right: the component tree. Screen1 contains lblHeading; HorizontalArrangement1, which contains btnMinus, lblCount and btnAdd; lblTotal; btnSpeak; btnReset; and TextToSpeech1, which is non-visible. A blocks box summarises the behaviour: plus adds 1 and minus takes away 1, never below 0; updateDisplay shows the count and the total, which is the count times US$2; Read my total speaks lblTotal.Text; Start again sets the count to 0.",
   "caption": "The tree lists the components in the same order they appear on screen. Renaming them btnAdd and lblTotal makes the blocks readable for you and the moderator.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 424\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"300\" height=\"404\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\">Viewer</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"42\" width=\"240\" height=\"316\" rx=\"18\" class=\"f-softb s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"52\" y=\"62\" width=\"216\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-surface\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"79.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Johnny Cake Counter</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">How many johnny cakes?</text><rect x=\"58\" y=\"128\" width=\"204\" height=\"70\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"138\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"170.7\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">-</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"138\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"170.7\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Total: US$0</text><rect x=\"58\" y=\"244\" width=\"204\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"266.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Read my total</text><rect x=\"58\" y=\"290\" width=\"204\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"312.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Start again</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"382\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">Non-visible components:</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">TextToSpeech1</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Components</text><text x=\"336\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Screen1</text><path d=\"M344 62V74H353\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"356\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"13\">lblHeading</text><path d=\"M344 84V96H353\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"356\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"13\">HorizontalArrangement1</text><path d=\"M364 106V118H373\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"376\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">btnMinus</text><path d=\"M364 128V140H373\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"376\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"13\">lblCount</text><path d=\"M364 150V162H373\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"376\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">btnAdd</text><path d=\"M344 172V184H353\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"356\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"13\">lblTotal</text><path d=\"M344 194V206H353\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"356\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">btnSpeak</text><path d=\"M344 216V228H353\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"356\" y=\"232\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\">btnReset</text><path d=\"M344 238V250H353\" class=\"s-muted f-none\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"356\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"13\">TextToSpeech1 (non-visible)</text><rect x=\"326\" y=\"290\" width=\"304\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"338\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\" font-weight=\"700\">Blocks (behaviour)</text><text x=\"338\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"13\">+ adds 1; − takes away 1, never below 0</text><text x=\"338\" y=\"347\" font-size=\"13\">updateDisplay shows the count and</text><text x=\"338\" y=\"364\" font-size=\"13\">the total = count × US$2</text><text x=\"338\" y=\"381\" font-size=\"13\">Read my total speaks lblTotal.Text</text><text x=\"338\" y=\"398\" font-size=\"13\">Start again sets the count to 0</text></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Testing, debugging, feedback and refinement",
   "title": "Figure 3.6.4 · Who tests what, and the refine loop",
   "alt": "An arrow runs from \"small parts of the code\" to \"real users in real conditions\" over five columns that grow taller from left to right. Unit testing, by developers: one procedure gives the right result, for example updateDisplay. Integration and system testing, by developers and testers: parts work together on old and new phones. Usability testing, with real users observed: can users complete tasks easily? UAT, user acceptance testing, by the client or end users: the app meets the agreed requirements and they sign off. Beta testing, by a wider group of real users: bugs in real conditions, using TestFlight or Play testing tracks. Below, a circular loop: build, test, learn, refine, labelled iterate. Notes: after every fix, run a regression test to check that the fix did not break something else; test on a budget Android phone, on mobile data, in bright sunlight and with TalkBack on.",
   "caption": "Unit testing checks a small part of the code and is done by developers; UAT checks the whole app against the requirements and is done by the client. The loop repeats until users can complete their tasks.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 432\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M3U6f4-m0\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M14 22L626 22\" class=\"s-gold f-none\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U6f4-m0)\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\">from small parts of the code ...</text><text x=\"626\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\">... to real users in real conditions</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"112\" width=\"116\" height=\"134\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Unit testing</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-gold\" font-weight=\"700\">Developers</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"173.9\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"68\" dy=\"0em\">One procedure</tspan><tspan x=\"68\" dy=\"1.2em\">gives the</tspan><tspan x=\"68\" dy=\"1.2em\">right result,</tspan><tspan x=\"68\" dy=\"1.2em\">e.g.</tspan><tspan x=\"68\" dy=\"1.2em\">updateDisplay</tspan></text><rect x=\"136\" y=\"100\" width=\"116\" height=\"146\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"194\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"194\" dy=\"0em\">Integration</tspan><tspan x=\"194\" dy=\"1.15em\">and system</tspan></text><text x=\"194\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-gold\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"194\" dy=\"0em\">Developers,</tspan><tspan x=\"194\" dy=\"1.15em\">testers</tspan></text><text x=\"194\" y=\"193.9\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"194\" dy=\"0em\">Parts work</tspan><tspan x=\"194\" dy=\"1.2em\">together on</tspan><tspan x=\"194\" dy=\"1.2em\">old and new</tspan><tspan x=\"194\" dy=\"1.2em\">phones</tspan></text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"88\" width=\"116\" height=\"158\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Usability</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-gold\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"0em\">Real users,</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"1.15em\">observed</tspan></text><text x=\"320\" y=\"164.9\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"0em\">Can users</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"1.2em\">complete tasks</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"1.2em\">easily?</tspan></text><rect x=\"388\" y=\"76\" width=\"116\" height=\"170\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"446\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">UAT</text><text x=\"446\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-gold\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"0em\">The client or</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"1.15em\">end users</tspan></text><text x=\"446\" y=\"152.9\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"0em\">Meets the</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"1.2em\">agreed</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"1.2em\">requirements;</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"1.2em\">sign-off</tspan></text><rect x=\"514\" y=\"64\" width=\"116\" height=\"182\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"572\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">Beta</text><text x=\"572\" y=\"107\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"0em\">A wider group</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"1.15em\">of real users</tspan></text><text x=\"572\" y=\"140.9\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\"><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"0em\">Bugs in real</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"1.2em\">conditions:</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"1.2em\">TestFlight,</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"1.2em\">Play testing</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"1.2em\">tracks</tspan></text><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"340\" r=\"70\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"257\" width=\"64\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"274.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">Build</text><rect x=\"168\" y=\"327\" width=\"64\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"344.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">Test</text><rect x=\"98\" y=\"397\" width=\"64\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"414.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">Learn</text><rect x=\"28\" y=\"327\" width=\"64\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"344.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"700\">Refine</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\">iterate</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"240\" dy=\"0em\">After every fix, run a regression test: check that</tspan><tspan x=\"240\" dy=\"1.25em\">the fix did not break something else.</tspan></text><text x=\"240\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"240\" dy=\"0em\">Test on a budget Android phone, on mobile data, in</tspan><tspan x=\"240\" dy=\"1.25em\">bright sunlight and with TalkBack on.</tspan></text></svg>"
  }
